<section id="simulator" class="simulator-section section" aria-labelledby="simulator-title"><div class="simulator-intro"><div class="section-kicker">Perencanaan anggota</div><h2 id="simulator-title">Hitung rencana<br><em>keuangan Anda.</em></h2><p>Gunakan simulator ini untuk membuat estimasi awal. Nilai akhir mengikuti kebijakan dan persetujuan koperasi.</p></div><div class="simulator-card"><div class="simulator-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Jenis simulasi"><button class="simulator-tab is-active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="loan-panel" data-sim-tab="loan">Simulasi pinjaman</button><button class="simulator-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="saving-panel" data-sim-tab="saving">Simulasi tabungan</button></div><div class="simulator-panel is-active" id="loan-panel" role="tabpanel" data-sim-panel="loan"><div class="simulator-fields"><label>Jumlah pinjaman<input type="number" min="1000000" step="500000" value="10000000" data-loan-principal></label><label>Tenor (bulan)<input type="number" min="1" max="60" step="1" value="12" data-loan-term></label><label>Estimasi jasa per tahun (%)<input type="number" min="0" max="30" step="0.1" value="12" data-loan-rate></label></div><div class="simulator-result"><span>Estimasi angsuran per bulan</span><strong data-loan-result>Rp 933.333</strong><small>Perhitungan flat sederhana, bukan penawaran resmi.</small></div></div><div class="simulator-panel" id="saving-panel" role="tabpanel" data-sim-panel="saving"><div class="simulator-fields"><label>Setoran rutin per bulan<input type="number" min="0" step="50000" value="500000" data-saving-deposit></label><label>Durasi (bulan)<input type="number" min="1" max="120" step="1" value="12" data-saving-term></label><label>Estimasi imbal hasil per tahun (%)<input type="number" min="0" max="20" step="0.1" value="3" data-saving-rate></label></div><div class="simulator-result"><span>Estimasi saldo akhir</span><strong data-saving-result>Rp 6.090.000</strong><small>Belum memperhitungkan biaya, pajak, atau ketentuan produk.</small></div></div></div></section>
